<title>USA: Airgas names Thomas Deas Jr CFO.</title>
<headline>Airgas names Thomas Deas Jr CFO.</headline>
<dateline>RADNOR, Pa. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airgas Inc said on Monday it has named Thomas Deas Jr. chief financial officer, effective February 24, 1997.</p>
<p>Deas most recently served as chief financial officer of Maritrans Inc after working at Scott Paper Co for 18 years in various financial and strategic management positions, the company said.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to provide the name of the previous chief financial officer.</p>
</text>
